  "sources": [
    {
      "sourceId": "text:aa66ed922efd83210d01e95bb4d0f851536d36b3908fa459231e0e26b0947bf0@utf8-pages-v1:aa66ed922efd83210d01e95bb4d0f851536d36b3908fa459231e0e26b0947bf0:p1",
      "documentId": "text:aa66ed922efd83210d01e95bb4d0f851536d36b3908fa459231e0e26b0947bf0",
      "name": "currency.txt",
      "version": "utf8-pages-v1:aa66ed922efd83210d01e95bb4d0f851536d36b3908fa459231e0e26b0947bf0",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "汇率风险说明。基金持有美元计价的境外资产，本币升值会压低换算后的本币收益。本产品不做外汇对冲，因此基金净值也会受到汇率变动影响。",
      "sha256": "aa66ed922efd83210d01e95bb4d0f851536d36b3908fa459231e0e26b0947bf0",
      "mediaType": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "text:ed0b79f1d5f45e219963c81abc32cbb027f0f1683999e8c52d742a4c5d21c05d@utf8-pages-v1:ed0b79f1d5f45e219963c81abc32cbb027f0f1683999e8c52d742a4c5d21c05d:p1",
      "documentId": "text:ed0b79f1d5f45e219963c81abc32cbb027f0f1683999e8c52d742a4c5d21c05d",
      "name": "concentration.txt",
      "version": "utf8-pages-v1:ed0b79f1d5f45e219963c81abc32cbb027f0f1683999e8c52d742a4c5d21c05d",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "组合集中度限制。单一发行人的债券市值不得超过净资产的百分之十。政府债券不受该项单一发行人上限约束。这是风险控制限制，不是收益预测。",
      "sha256": "ed0b79f1d5f45e219963c81abc32cbb027f0f1683999e8c52d742a4c5d21c05d",
      "mediaType": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "text:9af2ff6959bd9ecea86f6dc322fa0d45afb532d2398615f595b957cb17ebb06e@utf8-pages-v1:9af2ff6959bd9ecea86f6dc322fa0d45afb532d2398615f595b957cb17ebb06e:p1",
      "documentId": "text:9af2ff6959bd9ecea86f6dc322fa0d45afb532d2398615f595b957cb17ebb06e",
      "name": "rebalance-old.txt",
      "version": "utf8-pages-v1:9af2ff6959bd9ecea86f6dc322fa0d45afb532d2398615f595b957cb17ebb06e",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "已废止的2024年历史规则：每个季度末重新平衡一次组合。这一规则只用于历史回测，不适用于2026年的实际组合。",
      "sha256": "9af2ff6959bd9ecea86f6dc322fa0d45afb532d2398615f595b957cb17ebb06e",
      "mediaType": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "text:7874b49f5f2b55595cae93616a48d26631f930a204d7532951294924f4e21783@utf8-pages-v1:7874b49f5f2b55595cae93616a48d26631f930a204d7532951294924f4e21783:p1",
      "documentId": "text:7874b49f5f2b55595cae93616a48d26631f930a204d7532951294924f4e21783",
      "name": "rebalance-current.txt",
      "version": "utf8-pages-v1:7874b49f5f2b55595cae93616a48d26631f930a204d7532951294924f4e21783",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "指数调整现行规则，2026年生效。每年六月和十二月检查成份股权重，随后按目标比例调整组合。2024年的季度调整规则已废止。临时市场波动不触发额外的定期调整。",
      "sha256": "7874b49f5f2b55595cae93616a48d26631f930a204d7532951294924f4e21783",
      "mediaType": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
    }
  ],
